# Grid Table Structure Rules

Scope:
- Apply to `src/` and `portal/src/`.

Component folder contract:
- `Name.tsx` (single component per file)
- `Name.types.ts` (all public interfaces/types)
- `Name.const.ts` (reusable constants)
- `Name.utils.ts` (pure logic helpers)
- `index.ts` (barrel exports)

Structure constraints:
- Do not keep `types.ts` or `constants.ts` when `Name.types.ts` / `Name.const.ts` exists.
- If a component grows helper views, move to `_helper/<Name>/<Name>.tsx` plus `index.ts`.
- No multiple main components in one TSX file.
